# Lakeside Software

> Lakeside Software makes SysTrack, a digital employee experience (DEX) platform that collects
> 10,000+ datapoints every 15 seconds from every endpoint in an IT estate, then uses that first-party
> telemetry to find, diagnose, and automatically remediate the issues that degrade employee productivity.
> SysTrack AI adds agentic, autonomous IT support on top of that data.

Lakeside pairs the broadest endpoint dataset in the category with AI that acts on it - shifting IT from
reactive ticket-chasing to proactive, SRE-style reliability engineering for the end-user estate.

## Platform
- [SysTrack platform](https://www.lakesidesoftware.com/platform/): the DEX data engine - deep endpoint telemetry, analytics, and automation.
- [SysTrack AI](https://www.lakesidesoftware.com/systrack-ai/): the agentic AI layer for autonomous end-user-computing support.
- [Digital Employee Experience](https://www.lakesidesoftware.com/platform/capabilities/digital-employee-experience/): measure and improve the real experience employees have with their technology.
- [Proactive IT](https://www.lakesidesoftware.com/platform/capabilities/proactive-it/): detect and fix issues before employees feel them.
- [Observability & Insights](https://www.lakesidesoftware.com/platform/capabilities/): full-fidelity visibility across the endpoint estate.

